---
// IndEqStressReliefSection.astro
// Entity cluster: Stress-Relief Annealing + Micro-Structural Residual Tension + Crack Prevention
// Technical depth: Vacuum annealing, surface tensile stress elimination, cyclic impact crack propagation
---
<section class="relative py-24 overflow-hidden" style="background-color: var(--theme-bg);">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.015]">
    <svg class="w-full h-full" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><defs><pattern id="ind-hex" width="56" height="100" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><path d="M28 66L0 50L0 16L28 0L56 16L56 50L28 66L28 100" fill="none" stroke="var(--theme-primary)" stroke-width="0.5"/><path d="M28 0L28 34L0 50L0 84L28 100L56 84L56 50L28 34" fill="none" stroke="var(--theme-primary)" stroke-width="0.5"/></pattern></defs><rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#ind-hex)" /></svg>
  </div>
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 mb-4 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full border" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 10%, transparent); border-color: var(--theme-primary); color: var(--theme-primary);">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 013.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 003 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285z" /></svg>
        Stress Mitigation
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6" style="color: var(--theme-text);">
        <span style="color: var(--theme-primary);">Stress-Relief Annealing</span> — Eliminating Micro-Structural Residual Tension to Prevent Crack Propagation
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 65%, transparent);">
        Post-machining stress-relief vacuum annealing eliminates machining-induced residual tensile stress — stopping crack nucleation before it propagates under repetitive industrial strokes. Combined with automated polishing loops that remove micro-burrs, our process ensures industrial components survive millions of cycles without fatigue failure.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <div class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden" style="background-color: var(--theme-surface); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">
        <div class="p-8">
          <div class="flex items-start mb-5">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mr-4" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 10%, transparent);">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 013.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 003 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold" style="color: var(--theme-text);">Vacuum Stress-Relief Annealing</h3>
              <span class="text-sm font-medium" style="color: var(--theme-primary);">700-785°C · Vacuum Atmosphere · Zero Alpha-Case</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 60%, transparent);">
            CNC machining leaves residual tensile stresses on component surfaces — the initiation points for fatigue cracks under cyclic loading. Our vacuum stress-relief annealing process heats Grade 5 Titanium components to 700-785°C in an inert atmosphere, allowing grain boundary relaxation that neutralizes residual stress without forming alpha-case. The result: components that resist crack initiation under millions of industrial operating cycles.
          </p>
          <div class="mx-0 h-px mb-6" style="background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 30%, transparent), transparent);"></div>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4 block" style="color: var(--theme-primary);">Technical Implementation</span>
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            <li class="flex items-start text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 70%, transparent);"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mt-0.5 mr-2 shrink-0" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>Vacuum atmosphere annealing — zero alpha-case formation, no surface contamination</li>
            <li class="flex items-start text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 70%, transparent);"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mt-0.5 mr-2 shrink-0" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>700-785°C controlled ramp and soak — neutralizes residual tensile stress at grain boundaries</li>
            <li class="flex items-start text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 70%, transparent);"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mt-0.5 mr-2 shrink-0" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>Process certification per AMS 2801 — documented time-temperature profile per lot</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden" style="background-color: var(--theme-surface); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">
        <div class="p-8">
          <div class="flex items-start mb-5">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mr-4" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 10%, transparent);">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M11.42 15.17l-6.36 6.36M12 3v18m0-18l5.66 5.66M12 3L6.34 8.66M12 21l-5.66-5.66M12 21l5.66-5.66M3 12h18" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold" style="color: var(--theme-text);">Automated Polishing &amp; Burr Removal</h3>
              <span class="text-sm font-medium" style="color: var(--theme-primary);">Micro-Burr Elimination · Smooth Transitions</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 60%, transparent);">
            Micro-burrs and sharp edge transitions act as stress concentration points that nucleate cracks under cyclic industrial loading. Our automated polishing loops systematically deburr and radius all edges — internal passages, O-ring grooves, thread starts, and sealing surfaces. Each component undergoes final inspection under 10× magnification to verify zero burr condition before shipment.
          </p>
          <div class="mx-0 h-px mb-6" style="background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 30%, transparent), transparent);"></div>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4 block" style="color: var(--theme-primary);">Technical Implementation</span>
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            <li class="flex items-start text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 70%, transparent);"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mt-0.5 mr-2 shrink-0" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>Automated edge radius application — eliminates stress risers at all machined intersections</li>
            <li class="flex items-start text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 70%, transparent);"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mt-0.5 mr-2 shrink-0" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>10× magnification visual inspection — zero burr condition certified per component</li>
            <li class="flex items-start text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 70%, transparent);"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mt-0.5 mr-2 shrink-0" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>Consistent edge break specification — eliminates crack nucleation sites in high-cycle applications</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3 text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 50%, transparent);">
      <span class="font-semibold" style="color: var(--theme-primary);">Entity Cluster:</span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 8%, transparent); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">Stress-Relief Annealing</span>
      <span class="text-xs">+</span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 8%, transparent); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">Residual Tension Elimination</span>
      <span class="text-xs">+</span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 8%, transparent); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">Vacuum Annealing</span>
      <span class="text-xs">+</span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 8%, transparent); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">AMS 2801</span>
      <span class="text-xs">+</span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 8%, transparent); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">Micro-Burr Free</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
